:: StoryTitle
TypeScript In Passage

:: StoryData
{
  "ifid": "77777777-7777-4777-8777-777777777777",
  "format": "SugarCube",
  "format-version": "2.37.3"
}

:: Start
<<script>>
  interface Loot {
    name: string;
    value: number;
  }

  const drops: Loot[] = [
    { name: "rusty sword", value: 3 },
    { name: "healing herb", value: 7 },
  ];

  State.variables.gold = drops.reduce((total: number, item: Loot) => total + item.value, 0);
  State.variables.best = drops.map((item) => item.name).join(" and ");
<</script>>

You found $best, worth $gold gold.

[[Haggle]]

:: Haggle
<<script TypeScript>>
  const asking = State.variables.gold as number;
  State.variables.gold = Math.round(asking * 1.5);
<</script>>

Talked them up to $gold gold.

[[Tip]]

:: Tip
<<script TwineScript>>
$gold to $gold + 1;
<</script>>

And a tip: $gold gold.
